# The Note Air's state that a switch (an update, a reset) carries into the next
# deployment (GlassineOS/boot, docs/deployments.md, "Migrate lists")
# the Bluetooth address onyx-noteair-bringup made once: bluez keeps the pairings
# under it, a new one hides them
/var/lib/glassine/bt-address
# the real-time clock's offset (glassine-clock): the clock is right before the network
/var/lib/glassine/clock-offset
